<title>USA: Vacation Break enters merger talks.</title>
<headline>Vacation Break enters merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vacation Break U.S.A. Inc said on Tuesday that it is in talks about a possible merger.</p>
<p>A further announcement about the deal is expected later today or tomorrow after the company's directors meet, said Vacation Break, which specializes in vacation timeshares.</p>
<p>The company's shares were halted in Nasdaq trading at 10-3/4, up 1/2 for the day.</p>
</text>
